---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import FileDiagram from '../components/FileDiagram.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Layout title="File-level protection for a compromised world">
<section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="small-cross">+</span> BEYOND THE PERIMETER. INTO THE FILE.</span><h1>Protection that<br/>stays with<br/>the <span class="serif-word">file.</span><span class="lime-period">■</span></h1><p class="hero-lead">Your most sensitive data deserves a defense of its own. Protect files with fragmentation, encryption and controlled access—even as the systems around them face compromise.</p><div class="button-row"><a href="/request-demo" class="button button-dark">Request a demo <Arrow/></a><a href="/how-it-works" class="text-link">See how it works <span class="circle-arrow"><svg class="diagonal-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></span></a></div><div class="hero-footnote"><span class="mini-line"></span><span>Built around the file. Designed for defense in depth.</span></div></div><div class="hero-visual"><FileDiagram/></div></section>
<div class="audience-strip"><div class="container"><span class="tiny-label">SENSITIVE DATA.<br/>SERIOUS RESPONSIBILITY.</span><span>Enterprise security</span><span>Regulated industries</span><span>Government missions</span><a href="/enterprise" aria-label="Explore enterprise protection">Explore <span aria-hidden="true"><svg class="diagonal-arrow" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg></span></a></div></div>
<section class="section container risk-section"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE ASSUMPTION THAT CHANGES EVERYTHING</span><h2>What if the storage<br/>is no longer trusted?</h2></div><div class="risk-copy"><p class="large-copy">A compromised system shouldn’t be the end of your data protection story.</p><p>Perimeters, endpoint controls and storage encryption all play a role. Cyber Reliant adds another layer: protection applied to the file itself, with controls over how it is accessed and reconstructed.</p><a class="text-link" href="/enterprise">A different starting point for enterprise security <Arrow/></a></div></section>
<section class="mechanism-section"><div class="container section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">ONE FILE. MULTIPLE LAYERS OF PROTECTION.</span><h2>Make the file harder<br/>to turn into exposure.</h2></div><p>A coordinated architecture.<br/>From the way data is stored<br/>to the application that opens it.</p></div><div class="mechanism-grid"><a href="/how-it-works#fragment" class="mechanism-card"><span class="card-number">01 / FRAGMENT</span><div class="mini-art art-fragments"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h3>Break the whole<br/>into fragments.</h3><p>The file is divided into fragments as part of the protection process.</p><span class="card-link">Explore fragmentation <Arrow/></span></a><a href="/how-it-works#encrypt" class="mechanism-card"><span class="card-number">02 / ENCRYPT</span><div class="mini-art art-encrypt"><span>×</span><span>7</span><span>◇</span><span>+</span><b>⌑</b></div><h3>Protect the pieces.<br/>Protect the keys.</h3><p>Fragments are encrypted, with cryptographic material protected as a distinct part of the architecture.</p><span class="card-link">Explore encryption <Arrow/></span></a><a href="/how-it-works#distribute" class="mechanism-card"><span class="card-number">03 / DISTRIBUTE</span><div class="mini-art art-distribute"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><h3>Distribute storage.<br/>Control reconstruction.</h3><p>Protected fragments are distributed across storage locations and reconstructed through controlled access.</p><span class="card-link">Explore distribution <Arrow/></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section container app-section"><div class="application-visual"><div class="diagram-top"><span>APPLICATION ACCESS</span><span>FIG. 02</span></div><div class="app-path"><span class="app-symbol">▦</span><div><strong>Authorized application</strong><small>Permitted by application policy</small></div><span class="access-pill allowed">ALLOW</span></div><div class="app-path"><span class="app-symbol">▧</span><div><strong>Unapproved application</strong><small>Not permitted by application policy</small></div><span class="access-pill blocked">BLOCK</span></div><div class="access-gateway"><span>APPLICATION-LEVEL CONTROLS</span><span>↓</span></div><div class="protected-file"><span>▤</span><div><strong>Protected file access</strong><small>Controlled decryption + reconstruction</small></div><span class="status-dot"></span></div><p class="small-note">Conceptual policy flow. Enforcement depends on implementation and configuration.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">ACCESS IS MORE THAN A USERNAME</span><h2>The application<br/>matters, too.</h2><p>Access to a system should not give every application access to its protected files. Cyber Reliant adds application-level controls to the file-access path.</p><p>Its Windows implementation uses a file-system filter architecture in protection, encryption, decryption and reconstruction.</p><a class="text-link" href="/technology#windows">Explore the access architecture <Arrow/></a></div></section>
<section class="network-banner"><div class="container network-inner"><span class="outline-tag">UPCOMING NETWORK VERSION</span><h2>A distributed design.<br/>An HSM-based key architecture.</h2><div><p>The next step in protecting cryptographic material and distributing file fragments across multiple logical storage locations.</p><a class="text-link light-link" href="/technology#network">Inside the network architecture <Arrow/></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">DIFFERENT MISSIONS. THE SAME STAKES.</span><h2>For data you can’t<br/>afford to expose.</h2></div></div><div class="audience-cards"><a class="audience-card" href="/enterprise"><div class="audience-card-top"><span class="tiny-label">01 / ENTERPRISE</span><Arrow/></div><h3>Protect the information<br/>your business depends on.</h3><p>Intellectual property. Financial records. Sensitive operational files. Start with the data that matters most.</p><span class="text-link">Explore enterprise</span></a><a class="audience-card government-card" href="/government"><div class="audience-card-top"><span class="tiny-label">02 / GOVERNMENT</span><Arrow/></div><h3>Put sensitive mission<br/>data at the center.</h3><p>Evaluate file-level protection against your mission requirements, deployment constraints and security policies.</p><span class="text-link">Explore government</span></a></div></section>
<CTA/>
</Layout>
